# Optional. Without a key the Support Desk runs in clearly labelled demo mode
# (curated guide entries only, no AI-generated text) and letters use the template only.
# Server-side only: never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# Optional persistent storage (Upstash Redis REST). Server-side only.
# Without these, Vercel deployments keep records in temporary per-instance memory
# (labelled in the UI) and local runs use JSON files in ./.data.
# Vercel's Upstash integration may provide KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN instead; both are accepted.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Where local JSON data files live (default: ./.data)
# GWC_DATA_DIR=.data

# What counts as "today" (default: Asia/Kolkata)
# APP_TIME_ZONE=Asia/Kolkata
